</p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; TABLE-LAYOUT: fixed; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; HEIGHT: 128.41pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; WIDTH: 499.03pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 5.66pt; PADDING-TOP: 5.66pt; PADDING-LEFT: 14.17pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 14.17pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #800080; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">캠퍼스 특허전략 유니버시아드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #800080; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(CPU)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">는 수상자에게 많은 포상금과 대기업 취업의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기회가 주어지는 전국 최대 규모의 특허대전입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">창의지식재산센터에서는 대회일정에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">맞게 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #c75252 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #f52568; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">맞춤식 교육을 지원</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하여 본교 재학생들의 입상을 돕고자 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #c75252 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #f52568; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">변리사 및 지식재산권 분야 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #c75252 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #f52568; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">전문가를 통하여 사전교육과 멘토식 답안작성 지도교육</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 제공할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">특허 초보자도 두려워 마시고 많은 관심과 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"v\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:line id=\"_x364171704\" style=\"POSITION: absolute; v-text-anchor: top; mso-position-vertical-relative: page; mso-position-vertical: absolute; mso-position-horizontal-relative: margin; mso-position-horizontal: right\" to=\"481.89pt, 382.68pt\" strokeweight=\"3.40pt\" strokecolor=\"#f4dded\" from=\"0.00pt, 382.67pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"w\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" /--><w:wrap type=\"topAndBottom\"></w:wrap><v:stroke></v:stroke>